{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_917F412F","title":"Salt Pete Speaks","entry":"Dlg_917F412F::entry","exit":"Dlg_917F412F::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_722FADCE","articyId":"72057611218051036","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Belay yourself this way and have a chat with me, matey!","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Belay yourself this way and have a chat with me, matey!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":500.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30330","byteOffset":19354928,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_18F1BB41","articyId":"72057611218051050","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"A favor, you say? Dangerous things. But this old sea dog’s ears are like shells, whisper in my skull and all you’ll hear are the waves. Ha!","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A favor, you say? Dangerous things. But this old sea dog’s ears are like shells, whisper in my skull and all you’ll hear are the waves. Ha!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1100.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25298","byteOffset":17454888,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_BF0AFCD2","articyId":"72057611218051064","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Aye. But it's a secret club. Who told you?","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aye. But it's a secret club. Who told you?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1700.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41154","byteOffset":29897088,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_C5FFC9A5","articyId":"72057611218051078","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Calhoun? That slimy cove?","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Calhoun? That slimy cove?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2260.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35155","byteOffset":25660680,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_B10CBBDF","articyId":"72057611218051100","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Never! He baked his clam with us the day he lied about the Macrogillean! He broke the code! He shot his gull!","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Never! He baked his clam with us the day he lied about the Macrogillean! He broke the code! He shot his gull!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2850.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44946","byteOffset":31337344,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_AAD04E1D","articyId":"72057611218051121","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"But Calhoun wanted the glory for himself. So he took the boat and stole my best rod and then came back with some crusty tale.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But Calhoun wanted the glory for himself. So he took the boat and stole my best rod and then came back with some crusty tale.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3725.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30830","byteOffset":19544792,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_864E1299","articyId":"72057611218051135","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"So where is he, eh? Can’t see his boots on the dock.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So where is he, eh? Can’t see his boots on the dock.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38166","byteOffset":28773160,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_FB702571","articyId":"72057611218051149","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"The sewers? Pah, all he’ll catch down there are mutant jellies. No way to live.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The sewers? Pah, all he’ll catch down there are mutant jellies. No way to live.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4025.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21733","byteOffset":16112416,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_B7DAC0C6","articyId":"72057611218051163","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"He broke the fisherman’s code. We banished him from the wharf forever.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He broke the fisherman’s code. We banished him from the wharf forever.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4600.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48888","byteOffset":32836144,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_0F7B17DA","articyId":"72057611218051188","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Tsk, you'll never understand the ways of the sea. Just like Calhoun.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Tsk, you'll never understand the ways of the sea. Just like Calhoun.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4650.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41953","byteOffset":30198072,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_DA34F888","articyId":"72057611218051202","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Only one way to be un-banished. And it's something that old cove would never do.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Only one way to be un-banished. And it's something that old cove would never do.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5175.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46656","byteOffset":31983576,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_00F06582","articyId":"72057611218051217","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Apologize.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Apologize.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5750.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23307","byteOffset":16698800,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_95C9C4BA","articyId":"72057821671327160","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"It's not about belief, young lubber. It's about respect. We should ALL have gone to fish for the Baron that day.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's not about belief, young lubber. It's about respect. We should ALL have gone to fish for the Baron that day.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3425.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47756","byteOffset":32402152,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_261E0289","articyId":"72057611218051043","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Actually, I have a favor to ask you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Actually, I have a favor to ask you.","TextSheVersion":"Actually, I have a favor to ask you.","TextTheyVersion":"Actually, I have a favor to ask you."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":800.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36087","byteOffset":27999704,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_EA244E6B","articyId":"72057611218051057","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You're a member of the Carp Diem, right?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're a member of the Carp Diem, right?","TextSheVersion":"You're a member of the Carp Diem, right?","TextTheyVersion":"You're a member of the Carp Diem, right?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1399.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31589","byteOffset":19831704,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_53A8E837","articyId":"72057611218051071","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Calhoun.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Calhoun.","TextSheVersion":"Calhoun.","TextTheyVersion":"Calhoun."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1975.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17934","byteOffset":14673184,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_D57B7B81","articyId":"72057611218051085","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"He'd like to fish here again.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He'd like to fish here again.","TextSheVersion":"He'd like to fish here again.","TextTheyVersion":"He'd like to fish here again."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2550.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26737","byteOffset":17994048,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_C00057C3","articyId":"72057611218051092","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you know Calhoun?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you know Calhoun?","TextSheVersion":"Do you know Calhoun?","TextTheyVersion":"Do you know Calhoun?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1400.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32931","byteOffset":20343272,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_6E0ADC6F","articyId":"72057611218051107","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Well, he regrets that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, he regrets that.","TextSheVersion":"Well, he regrets that.","TextTheyVersion":"Well, he regrets that."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45243","byteOffset":31450792,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_A8BD50FC","articyId":"72057611218051114","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"He swears he caught it. Why don't you believe him?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He swears he caught it. Why don't you believe him?","TextSheVersion":"He swears he caught it. Why don't you believe him?","TextTheyVersion":"He swears he caught it. Why don't you believe him?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script"